classDiagram
    direction TB

    class Ticket {
        +String id
        +String title
        +String description
        +String locationId
        +String reporterId
        +Date createdAt
        +String categoryId
        +Priority priority
        +String technicianId
        +Date resolvedAt
        -TicketState state
        +status() TicketStatus
        +create(input)$ Ticket
        +rehydrate(snapshot)$ Ticket
        +qualify(data)
        +reject()
        +assign(technicianId)
        +start()
        +resolve()
        +close()
        +reopen()
        +setState(state)
        +toSnapshot() TicketSnapshot
    }

    class TicketState {
        <<interface>>
        +status TicketStatus
        +qualify(ticket, data)
        +reject(ticket)
        +assign(ticket, technicianId)
        +start(ticket)
        +resolve(ticket)
        +close(ticket)
        +reopen(ticket)
    }

    class BaseState {
        <<abstract>>
    }

    class NewState
    class QualifiedState
    class AssignedState
    class InProgressState
    class ResolvedState
    class ClosedState
    class RejectedState

    Ticket "1" o-- "1" TicketState : etat courant
    TicketState <|.. BaseState
    BaseState <|-- NewState
    BaseState <|-- QualifiedState
    BaseState <|-- AssignedState
    BaseState <|-- InProgressState
    BaseState <|-- ResolvedState
    BaseState <|-- ClosedState
    BaseState <|-- RejectedState

    note for BaseState "Pattern State<br/>BaseState refuse toute transition (erreur 409).<br/>Chaque etat redefinit seulement ses transitions valides<br/>et cree l'etat suivant via ticket.setState().<br/>stateFromStatus() reconstruit l'etat depuis la base."

    class AssignmentStrategy {
        <<interface>>
        +name string
        +pickTechnician(ticket, technicians) Technician
    }

    class ManualStrategy {
        -technicianId string
    }
    class LeastLoadedStrategy
    class CategorySkillStrategy

    class Technician {
        <<type>>
        +String id
        +String name
        +String[] skills
        +int openTickets
    }

    AssignmentStrategy <|.. ManualStrategy
    AssignmentStrategy <|.. LeastLoadedStrategy
    AssignmentStrategy <|.. CategorySkillStrategy
    AssignmentStrategy ..> Ticket : lit la categorie
    AssignmentStrategy ..> Technician : choisit parmi

    note for AssignmentStrategy "Pattern Strategy<br/>buildStrategy(name) retourne l'implementation<br/>demandee : manual, least-loaded ou category."
